But I am trying to build
a brighter tomorrow,

247
00:19:55,930 --> 00:19:59,901
and I can not do that if she
keeps dredging up the past.

248
00:19:59,934 --> 00:20:01,536
I mean, you remember
what it was like.

249
00:20:01,569 --> 00:20:04,204
- Surprised you do,
it's been so long, I...

