253
00:20:18,586 --> 00:20:19,954
- Is this a joke to you?

254
00:20:19,987 --> 00:20:22,824
- It's funny. Just not "ha ha."

255
00:20:24,324 --> 00:20:27,227
- I'm telling you, this
town can not go through

256
00:20:27,260 --> 00:20:29,831
