- Don't believe in luck.

640
01:00:08,577 --> 01:00:11,245
The mayor's your problem.
The monster's mine.

641
01:00:11,912 --> 01:00:14,448
- Well, actually, Cindy,

642
01:00:14,482 --> 01:00:18,419
I really think that something
bigger is going on here.

643
01:00:18,452 --> 01:00:20,154
