648
01:00:41,175 --> 01:00:43,377
I am not gonna be
a victim anymore.

649
01:00:43,410 --> 01:00:44,478
- Come on, this is crazy.

650
01:00:44,513 --> 01:00:46,046
- Don't call me that.

651
01:00:46,080 --> 01:00:47,616
- I'm sorry. I didn't mean that.

652
01:00:47,648 --> 01:00:49,183
- Then don't say it.

653
01:00:50,351 --> 01:00:51,719
I'm not crazy.

654
