there at night.

755
01:08:25,138 --> 01:08:27,542
- I have to, before she does.

756
01:08:29,409 --> 01:08:32,580
- Sh, Sheriff, you
gotta go after him.

757
01:08:33,648 --> 01:08:35,683
- Not at night. You
can't go there at night.

758
01:08:35,717 --> 01:08:38,086
