danger was rising

764
01:09:09,884 --> 01:09:11,853
as the battle grew nearer,

765
01:09:13,153 --> 01:09:16,791
but who's hunting who was
becoming less and less clearer.

766
01:09:29,436 --> 01:09:31,304
